@HostAddress = https://localhost:7175
@Token = replace-with-jwt

### List registered compiled Razor templates
GET {{HostAddress}}/api/communication/templates/razor
Authorization: Bearer {{Token}}

### List reusable merge snippets
GET {{HostAddress}}/api/communication/snippets
Authorization: Bearer {{Token}}

### List registered communication transports (SMTP, SendGrid, Mailgun, Twilio SMS, Push Stub, Dev Sink)
GET {{HostAddress}}/api/communication/transports
Authorization: Bearer {{Token}}

### List seeded & custom transactional SystemCommunications
GET {{HostAddress}}/api/communication/system-communications
Authorization: Bearer {{Token}}

### Register an organization E.164 SystemPhoneNumber
POST {{HostAddress}}/api/communication/phone-numbers
Authorization: Bearer {{Token}}
Content-Type: application/json

{
  "name": "Main Member Support SMS",
  "number": "+15552345678",
  "isSmsEnabled": true,
  "isSmsForwardingEnabled": false,
  "isActive": true
}

### Register a PersonalDevice push token
POST {{HostAddress}}/api/communication/personal-devices
Authorization: Bearer {{Token}}
Content-Type: application/json

{
  "platform": "Ios",
  "pushRegistrationToken": "apns-device-token-demo-0123456789abcdef",
  "deviceName": "Jordan iPhone 16",
  "notificationsEnabled": true
}

### Dispatch a transactional SystemCommunication
POST {{HostAddress}}/api/communication/system-communications/send
Authorization: Bearer {{Token}}
Content-Type: application/json

{
  "systemCommunicationKey": "finance.payment-or-gift-receipt",
  "recipientEmail": "jordan@example.org",
  "recipientName": "Jordan Taylor",
  "recipientPhoneNumber": "+15559990000",
  "mergeFields": {
    "ReceiptNumber": "RCPT-1042",
    "Amount": "$250.00",
    "AccountName": "Annual Community Scholarship Fund",
    "TaxDeductibleNotice": "Tax-deductible charitable contribution"
  },
  "triggerSource": "ManualHttpTest"
}

### Inspect recent transactional notification logs
GET {{HostAddress}}/api/communication/system-communications/logs?limit=25
Authorization: Bearer {{Token}}

### Inspect dev in-memory captured messages
GET {{HostAddress}}/api/communication/transports/in-memory-messages?limit=25
Authorization: Bearer {{Token}}

### List reusable bulk communication templates (W3-S6)
GET {{HostAddress}}/api/communication/bulk-templates
Authorization: Bearer {{Token}}

### Preview structured EmailSection composer output (W3-S6)
POST {{HostAddress}}/api/communication/bulk-templates/preview-email
Authorization: Bearer {{Token}}
Content-Type: application/json

{
  "subjectTemplate": "{{ OrganizationName | default:'Ruth' }} — Weekly Update",
  "sections": [
    {
      "order": 0,
      "kind": "HeroBanner",
      "heading": "Hello {{ RecipientName | default:'Member' }}",
      "bodyMarkup": "Welcome to this week's community update."
    },
    {
      "order": 1,
      "kind": "CallToActionButton",
      "buttonLabel": "Open Member Portal",
      "buttonUrl": "https://example.org/portal"
    }
  ]
}

### Create a draft bulk Communication campaign (W3-S6)
POST {{HostAddress}}/api/communication/campaigns
Authorization: Bearer {{Token}}
Content-Type: application/json

{
  "title": "Spring Community Digest",
  "channel": "Email",
  "topicKey": "community-digest",
  "isBulk": true,
  "subject": "Spring Highlights — {{ OrganizationName | default:'Ruth' }}",
  "sections": [
    {
      "order": 0,
      "kind": "RichText",
      "heading": "Community Calendar",
      "bodyMarkup": "<p>Registration is now open for upcoming cohorts.</p>"
    }
  ],
  "recipients": [
    {
      "destinationAddress": "alex@example.org",
      "displayName": "Alex Rivera"
    }
  ]
}

### Dispatch due approved bulk campaigns immediately (W3-S6)
POST {{HostAddress}}/api/communication/campaigns/dispatch-due
Authorization: Bearer {{Token}}
Content-Type: application/json

{
  "maxRecipientsPerRun": 200
}

### Ingest provider bounce/open/click telemetry webhook (W3-S6)
POST {{HostAddress}}/api/communication/webhooks/events
Content-Type: application/json

{
  "events": [
    {
      "eventType": "Opened",
      "destinationAddress": "alex@example.org"
    },
    {
      "eventType": "Clicked",
      "destinationAddress": "alex@example.org",
      "clickedUrl": "https://example.org/portal"
    }
  ]
}

### Ingest inbound two-way SMS webhook (W3-S6)
POST {{HostAddress}}/api/communication/sms/webhook
Content-Type: application/json

{
  "fromPhoneNumber": "+15554443322",
  "toPhoneNumber": "+15552345678",
  "messageBody": "HELP",
  "senderDisplayName": "Alex Rivera"
}

### List two-way SMS inbox conversations (W3-S6)
GET {{HostAddress}}/api/communication/sms/conversations
Authorization: Bearer {{Token}}

### List SMS keyword responder pipelines (W3-S6)
GET {{HostAddress}}/api/communication/sms/pipelines
Authorization: Bearer {{Token}}

### List automated multi-step CommunicationFlow drip campaigns (W3-S7)
GET {{HostAddress}}/api/communication/flows
Authorization: Bearer {{Token}}

### Advance due CommunicationFlow drip steps immediately (W3-S7)
POST {{HostAddress}}/api/communication/flows/advance-due
Authorization: Bearer {{Token}}
Content-Type: application/json

{
  "maxRecipientsPerRun": 200
}
